---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import BrandMark from "../components/ui/BrandMark.astro";
import { LIVE_APPS } from "../data/apps";

const live = LIVE_APPS.length;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Dalsicore"
  description="Dalsicore is a solo Android studio in Indonesia, started as Euni Dev. It has shipped 20+ apps, runs one live product, and applies what it learned from the ones it retired."
>
  <section class="section container about">
    <h1 class="section-title reveal delay-1">One person, 20+ shipped apps, and the lessons that only came from doing the work.</h1>

    <div class="cols">
      <div class="prose reveal delay-2">
        <p class="lead">
          I'm <strong>Anaf Naufalian</strong>, and I run Dalsicore on my own from Indonesia.
        </p>

        <p>
          I started out shipping apps under the name <strong>Euni Dev</strong>. Between 2022 and
          2024 I published more than 20 apps to Google Play. Most stayed small. A few picked up a
          handful of installs and some kind ratings, and the rest never found an audience. One by
          one, I retired them.
        </p>

        <p>
          That stretch taught me more than a single win would have. Shipping is a skill. Getting
          people to come back is a different problem. So I stopped counting apps and started working
          on depth instead.
        </p>

        <p>
          In 2025 I rebranded to <strong>Dalsicore</strong>. Fewer products, better execution, and
          AI built into how the work gets done. It is the same one-person operation, under a name
          that matches what I build now.
        </p>

        <p>
          Today Dalsicore ships SubsTracker, an Android subscription tracker, builds Aquri, a
          hydration app that nudges instead of asking for manual logs, and runs Dalsilens, research
          into color accessibility on mobile. The name is new. The habit of ship, measure, learn,
          ship again is not.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="side reveal delay-3">
        <div class="card surface">
          <div class="card-head">
            <BrandMark />
            <span>Dalsicore</span>
          </div>
          <dl>
            <div>
              <dt>Founder</dt>
              <dd>Anaf Naufalian</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Dalsicore brand</dt>
              <dd>Launched 2025, previously Euni Dev</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Team</dt>
              <dd>One, a solo founder</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Based in</dt>
              <dd>Indonesia</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Apps shipped</dt>
              <dd>20+</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Live products</dt>
              <dd>{live}</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div class="card surface note">
          <h2>One person, full stack</h2>
          <p>
            Design, build, release and upkeep all run through one pair of hands. It is a slower
            way to start and a faster way to learn, and it means every decision in a product has
            a reason behind it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 1120px;
  }

  .cols {
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-7);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .prose p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-1);
    font-size: 1.06rem;
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .prose .lead {
    color: var(--text-0);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.45rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .prose strong {
    color: var(--text-0);
  }

  .side {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    position: sticky;
    top: 92px;
  }

  .card {
    padding: var(--space-5);
  }

  .card-head {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  dl {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  dl > div {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-0);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  dl > div:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  dt {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-0);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .note {
    background: var(--bg-1);
  }

  .note h2 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .note p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-1);
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .cols {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-6);
    }

    .side {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
